# The build context is the repository root (apps/api/Dockerfile expects it), so
# everything not needed to build the API is excluded here — otherwise the
# context includes the PDF spike's own Chromium install and every node_modules
# tree, and the upload alone takes minutes.

node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo

.git
.github
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Its own dependency tree, deliberately outside the workspace.
docs/spikes

apps/web
docs
*.md
!apps/api/assets/fonts/README.md

**/coverage
**/.vitest
